 "sentences": [
  "This skyscraper was demolished on purpose.",
  "270 Park Avenue stood 52 stories tall in Midtown Manhattan.",
  "Architects Gordon Bunshaft and Natalie de Blois designed it for Union Carbide in 1960.",
  "It later served as the global headquarters for JPMorgan Chase.",
  "Two-thirds of the structure was built directly over underground railroad tracks.",
  "It remains the tallest voluntarily demolished building in the United States."
